# PEZHWAN — ESLint ignore (legacy format).
#
# The project lints with ESLint 9 flat config (see eslint.config.*), which
# ignores node_modules and dotfiles by default and no longer reads this file.
# Kept for tooling that still consumes a classic .eslintignore, and for the
# explicit excludes below that do not belong in flat config ignore patterns.

dist/
coverage/
*.min.js
package-lock.json